OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged and two released on
OL,4,Abail after car hit by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with possessing
OL,7,Fan offensive weapon after a car was hit
OL,8,Fby gunshots.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police (SWP) said a vehicle
OL,11,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,12,Ffirearms discharge" on Clase Road,
OL,13,FMorristion, Swansea at 16:14 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday, prompting a response from armed
OL,15,Fofficers.
OL,17,FThomas Gilheany, 29, who was also
OL,18,Fcharged with affray, is set to appear
OL,19,Fat Swansea Magistrates' Court on
OL,20,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
