OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged and two released on
OL,4,Abail after car hit by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man and 16-year-old boy,
OL,7,Fboth from Llansamlet, Swansea, who were
OL,8,Fboth arrested in connection with the
OL,9,Fincident, have been released on bail.
